  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato and carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut beetroot into small chunks. Slice brown onion into thick wedges.\n• Spread prepped veggies across two lined oven trays. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt and pepper.\n• Toss veggies to coat, then spread out in a single layer. Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634e4c426752c4301e0fed0d/step-0fcb51bc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water.\n• Roughly chop walnuts and parsley.\n• When the veggies have 5 minutes remaining, drain haloumi. Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add the honey, mixed sesame seeds and parsley and cook, turning haloumi, until fragrant and coated, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634e4c426752c4301e0fed0d/step-9b86b418.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the tray with the roasted veggies, add baby spinach leaves and a drizzle of red wine vinegar and olive oil.\n• Gently toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634e4c426752c4301e0fed0d/step-76ab6cc7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide roast veggie toss between bowls. Top with honey, sesame and parsley haloumi.\n• Sprinkle with walnuts to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/634e4c426752c4301e0fed0d/step-0c0cc392.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
